      "body": "Please add the following text at the end.\r\n\r\n_Affilition is for your own organisation. That means you are an employer or otherwise working for the organisation. The affiliation request is sent to support@peeringdb.com if no one is affiliated to the organisation yet. Otherwise, the admins are contacted. Only affiliate once per organisation. If you don't get an answer within a couple of days, please contact support@peeringdb.com_\r\n\r\nNative speakers, please feel free to improve this text. @peeringdb/pc (esp. @shane-kerr ) +1, please",
