      "body": "@shane-kerr, there might be confidentiality or also security concerns when sending the list of administrators. But if we don't send the list the sentence \"... or if the admins are no longer able to help,\" does not really make sense as the requestor does not know whether there is an administrator at all. Maybe sending partial information like ar****@***per.de would help. Someone familiar with the organisation would probably be able to decipher the address. ",
