      "created_at": "2020-01-03T15:48:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2020-01-03T15:48:00Z",
      "body": "> Would it be harmful if the requestor gets an email with a list of admin addresses, once the request is kicked off? Sometimes users wait for ages because the current admin left the organisation.\r\n\r\nSeems like something to split into another issue, since this one is pretty straightforward (change the text). Let's focus on that here since it's an easy win and discuss privacy concerns in a separate issue? \r\n\r\n+1 to @shane-kerr's revised text.  \r\n\r\n",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "pin": null,
